sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Assess as Assess page (Next.js)
    participant API as /api/predict-compare
    participant Model as Model artifacts

    User->>Assess: 1. Submit applicant form
    activate Assess
    Assess->>API: 2. POST applicant payload
    activate API
    API->>API: 3. Validate fields and bounds
    API->>Model: 4. Build 37-column feature vector
    activate Model
    API->>API: 5. Walk trees - Gradient Boosting, XGBoost, Random Forest
    Model-->>API: 6. Raw margins / raw scores per model
    deactivate Model
    API->>API: 7. Calibrate each model (Platt scaling)
    API-->>Assess: 8. Return PD, band, decision, contributions per model
    deactivate API
    Assess->>User: 9. Render risk slip and comparison panel
    deactivate Assess
